{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t美國總統特朗普宣稱，巴西總統選舉被操縱，認為當局延長投票時間非常奇怪。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n在北京，外交部發言人郭嘉昆在例行記者會回應有關提問時表示，中方尊重巴西人民的自主選擇。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n郭嘉昆昨日表示，中方祝賀盧拉勝選，願與巴方共同努力，持續推進中巴命運共同體建設。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：盧曉珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T08:42:13.270261+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T08:24:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T19:39:18.786991+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T08:38:40.219115+00:00","content_hash":"999982b4199aebcfc2a0a51752301f1e5472d670d54c828ad4f0e7433aeb97d1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}